/--
If `range f = ker g` and the target of `g` is torsion-free, then the
cokernel of `f` is torsion-free.
-/
theorem cokernel_torsion_ker
    (f : M →ₗ[R] N) (g : N →ₗ[R] P)
    [Module.IsTorsionFree R P]
