/-!
# Exact normalization of the two signed Hall-Witt heads

The exact Hall-Witt trace retains two signed triple heads:

* `[[z⁻¹, x⁻¹], y]`;
* `[[y⁻¹, z], x⁻¹]`.

Each signed inner bracket is an exact conjugate of a root-swapped ordinary
