Below a fixed cutoff, the integral Hall-Witt strict trace is supported on a
coefficient-independent finite vocabulary.  This file records the resulting
formal fixed slots and their scalar occurrence multiplicities.

These occurrence coordinates do not reorder the noncommutative trace.  They
