/-!
# Signed global Newton recipe expansions for Hall-Witt strict tails

Package the complete-natural-domain positive and negative Hall-Witt
strict-tail recipes behind the same integral-coefficient dispatch as the
literal strict trace.  The resulting finite vector recovers every retained
cutoff-profile coordinate for every integer coefficient.

