/-!
# Ordered concrete Hall-coordinate recipe vectors for strict tails

Choose the basis supplied by the canonical Hall-family theorem and expose its
Newton-normalized signed coordinate recipes as finite ordered vectors.  The
order is the existing linear order on the recursively constructed finite Hall
index type.

