/-!
# Current-word discounts for outer Hall-Witt crossing schedules

When the outer, selected, and original right-hand words are Hall-Witt current
words, their weights are all three.  A nonempty outer crossing coordinate
therefore leaves a `3 * innerDepth + 2` reserve after paying for its recursive
depth-word orbit.

The file is intentionally not imported by the existing collection proof.
-/

namespace Submission
namespace TCTex
namespace TCDiscou

open CWTrace
open WSTrace
open NPTail
