/-!
# Current-word discounts for fixed-source nested Hall-Witt coefficients

Each active inner packet selects a nonempty outer crossing subword.  For
Hall-Witt current words, the outer schedule leaves enough reserve to pay both
the inner depth and one additional unit.  Fixed nested coefficients are
therefore discounted by `source.sum + source.length`.

The file is intentionally not imported by the existing collection proof.
-/

namespace Submission
namespace TCTex
namespace CDCoeff

open CWTrace
open WSTrace
open NPTail
open RMRecb
open TACompos
open BDExp
open DCSched
open STSched
open STClos
