`prod_{w | v} L_wˣ` is coinduced from `L_w0ˣ` with its decomposition-group
action. -/
noncomputable def completionInducedIso
    (v : AbsoluteValue K ℝ) (w0 : CompletionPlacesAbove (L := L) v)
