finite-dimensional.  The hypotheses use each field's canonical algebra. -/
theorem finset_i_dimensional
    {Omega ι : Type*} [Field Omega] [Algebra ℚ Omega]
    (t : ι → IntermediateField ℚ Omega) (s : Finset ι)
    (hfin : ∀ i,
