  intro x y
  change ‖algebraMap ℚ K (x + y)‖ ≤
    max ‖algebraMap ℚ K x‖ ‖algebraMap ℚ K y‖
  simpa only [map_add] using
    (IsUltrametricDist.norm_add_le_max (algebraMap ℚ K x) (algebraMap ℚ K y))

