partial sums of coefficient norms gives absolute convergence to the right of
that exponent. -/
theorem absolute_variant {f : ℕ → ℂ} {b : ℝ} {s : ℂ}
    (hO : (fun n ↦ ∑ k ∈ Icc 1 n, ‖f k‖) =O[atTop] fun n ↦ (n : ℝ) ^ b)
